{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_017A2sMhEvKrhGKqpgT3fYHr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 33 tests pass, including all differential tests against `gshuf`. Here's what was implemented:\n\n**R3.1 (`--random-source=FILE`)**: Added `randomSource` field to options, `--random-source`/`--random-source=FILE` flag parsing, and `makeRNG()` which reads the file, uses the first 32 bytes as a ChaCha8 seed, and returns a deterministic `*rand.Rand`. All shuffle/random operations route through `randShuffle`/`randIntN` helpers that use either the seeded RNG or the global one.\n\n**R3.2 (`-z`/`--zero-terminated`)**: Added `zeroTerm` field, `-z`/`--zero-terminated` flag parsing, NUL-based splitting in `readFileLines` (switched from `bufio.Scanner` to `io.ReadAll` + `bytes.Split` to handle both delimiters), and `writeLine` helper that appends NUL or newline based on the flag.\n\n**R3.3 (`-e`/`--echo`)**: Added `echo` field, `-e`/`--echo` flag parsing, and echo-mode handling in `collectLines` that returns positional args directly as lines. Added `-e` + `-i` conflict detection.\n\n**R3.4 (empty input)**: Already handled by the `len(lines) == 0` early return in `writeOutput`; added explicit test coverage."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1586,"cache_read_input_tokens":46770,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1586},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"47895cbe-856d-4389-8852-374f7a40f991","uuid":"275d658f-26a0-4059-9210-f373d9f43f82"}
